tips.FOR:
Loop:

```c
for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    printf("%d\n", i);
}
```

tips.WHILE:
Loop:

```c
while (running) {
    step();
}
```
Test happens before each iteration.

tips.SWITCH:
Branch on a value:

```c
switch (c) {
    case 'a': ...; break;
    default: ...;
}
```
Each `case` needs a `break` unless you want fall-through.
